!Sample_molecule_ch1 = total RNA
!Sample_extract_protocol_ch1 = The brain hemisphere was removed after cold PBS transcardial perfusion, and tissues were cut into pieces and transferred to the gentleMACSTM C tubes (Miltenyi Biotec) containing the Adult Brain Dissociation kit mouse and rat (Miltenyi Biotec, 130-107-677) enzyme mixture. The brain tissue dissociated with gentleMACSTM program 37°C _ABDK_1 with run 30 min incubations on the MACSmix tube rotator. The supernatant was aspirated, the pellet was resuspended in 8ml of 40% Percoll (GE Healthcare) and overlaid on the top of 4ml of 80% Percoll. The myelin debris was removed using Percoll separation. The gradient is centrifuged at 2200rpm for 20 min without brake at 22°C. Cells were collected 40% to 80% interface and washed with PBS and stained with Zombie NIRTM Fixable viability kit (Biolegend, 423106). The cells were washed by PBS for two times.
!Sample_extract_protocol_ch1 = BD FACS Aria III (BD Biosciences) was used for sorting brain single live cells. Each cell suspension was subjected to 3′ single-cell RNA sequencing using Single Cell A Chip Kit, Single Cell 3′ Library and Gel Bead Kit V2, and i7 Multiplex Kit (10x Genomics) with a cell recovery target of 9000, following the manufacturer’s instructions
!Sample_description = Prdx1 -/- tMCAO 48h contralateral hemisphere
!Sample_data_processing = The single cell RNA libraries constructed by 10x Single Cell chip A kit are sequenced by llumina HiSeq2500 Instrument
!Sample_data_processing = Illumina fastq files are aligned on mm10 reference genome by Cell ranger
!Sample_data_processing = barcode, feature, and matrix file which are output file of Cell ranger are imported to R with Read10x function of Seurat  package
!Sample_data_processing = 10x data are converted to seurat object CreateSeuratObject function of seurat package
!Sample_data_processing = Multiplet data are eliminated by doubletFinder package
!Sample_data_processing = Genome_build: mm10
!Sample_data_processing = Supplementary_files_format_and_content: Matrix file of barcodes and genes which shows gene expression of each single cells.
!Sample_platform_id = GPL17021
